{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/2mexq4","slideIndex":0,"text":"Hello, my name is [your name]. Today I want to introduce Pawprint. Imagine coming home and seeing a photograph of your pet. You remember its face, and the little moments a photo cannot show: coming when you called, or wagging its tail at the door. Could technology offer another way to remember them?"}
