{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/6pcn214v","slideIndex":1,"position":{"left":78,"top":175,"width":780,"height":150},"text":"A photo preserves a face.\nWe also remember the small moments.","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":43,"typeface":"Aptos","color":"#263A32","bold":true,"alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/7ql4v65g","slideIndex":1,"position":{"left":80,"top":382,"width":660,"height":100},"text":"Pawprint explores a way to revisit those memories through a digital keepsake.","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":25,"typeface":"Aptos","color":"#5D6B61","alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"image","id":"im/1onix8b2","slideIndex":1,"position":{"left":900,"top":170,"width":300,"height":360},"fit":"cover","name":"","alt":"Pawprint project imagery"}
{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/8w4rd4","slideIndex":1,"text":"For someone who has lost a pet, ordinary moments can mean a great deal. Pawprint explores an interactive digital keepsake using pet photos, a 3D character, and the owner’s own memories. The idea is to offer another way to revisit those memories. The illustration is project artwork, not evidence of user outcomes."}
