{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/yx8dcu","slideIndex":2,"text":"This is Lanlao, our demonstration companion. People can interact, stop whenever they choose, and write down a memory. The character is a simulation. It cannot bring a pet back or reveal what the animal really thinks. A new candidate model needs its own review and does not automatically have all of Lanlao’s animations."}
