{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/d1ptm9","slideIndex":4,"text":"We tested a separate offline command parser. On 68 development examples, expected-action matches rose from 28 to 64 after revisions. Among 32 negative examples, unwanted actions fell from 29 to zero. Four expected actions were still missed. These examples helped us make fixes, so this is not an independent accuracy score and does not measure the language model. Source: review/SUBMISSION-KIT.md and the project evidence page."}
