{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/g8rdoq","slideIndex":5,"text":"Users can choose text or buttons, stop an interaction and decide whether to request a memory draft. Photos and text sent to external services have privacy implications; local deletion does not guarantee provider deletion. Pawprint is a creative keepsake, not a treatment, and we have not established an effect on grief or wellbeing. Next we plan an independent language-model test and a usability comparison with a static photo, involving consenting adults. My verified contribution was [describe your actual work]. We acknowledge external services, existing assets and AI assistance. Thank you."}